  "priorExpiration": "2016-01-12",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3208.04 Motorcycle Inspection Station Sign.\n\n(a) Each official motorcycle inspection station shall display a sign pursuant to Saf-C 3208.02(a) with the addition of the word \"Motorcycle\" on the bottom of the sign.\n\n(b) Each official motorcycle inspection station sign shall:\n\n(1) Be white with green lettering; and\n\n(2) Be 4 inches in height by 22 inches in length.\n\n(c) Each letter shall be no less than 2 ¼ inches in height with a ½ inch brush stroke.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes at Chapter Heading Saf-C 3200) #8915, eff 6-22-07, EXPIRED: 6-22-15\n\nNew. #10886, INTERIM, eff 7-16-15, EXPIRES: 1-12-16; ss by #11016, eff 1-6-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c3200.html"
